Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:36.20,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单第一轮
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:36.20,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 柳托娃 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Qinwen, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,钦文 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,First of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,it is your first Grand Slam main draw win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你久违的大满贯正赛胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in a little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,隔了好一阵子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,while, and you looked incredible doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且你今天打得非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,What was the key,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,关键是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,particularly after that first set?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是在丢掉第一盘之后？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all, I want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 我想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to say congratulation first to the opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,先恭喜我的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,because she's only 16 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为她才 16 岁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,very young junior,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是个很年轻的青少年球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and she play incredible tennis, fights a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,她打得非常出色 也很能拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.64,EN,,0,0,0,,It was not easy for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球对我来说不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but first congratulation to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但首先还是要恭喜她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And second I mean my body wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二 我的身体状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,in the best shape
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,并不在最好的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:36.40,EN,,0,0,0,,because I was a bit sick few days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为几天前我有点生病
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and it was tough for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,有那么一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to keep the consistent in one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很难保持稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I was feeling a bit dizzy on court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上我觉得有点头晕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:44.00,EN,,0,0,0,,but I just say today what what I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我告诉自己 今天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,can do is only to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我能做的只有拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and let's see what's happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后看看会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:49.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to get this match cuz it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,能赢下这场球我太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.48,EN,,0,0,0,,was really tough for me physically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这场球在身体上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and mentally like you say it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,和心理上都很难 正如你所说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:56.08,EN,,0,0,0,,was my first Grand Slam main draw win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我一年多来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:58.32,EN,,0,0,0,,more than a year that was means
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一场大满贯正赛胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot to me and I want to say thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我意义重大 我想说声谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:02.88,EN,,0,0,0,,for all the crowd who come
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢今天到场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to support me today I I love you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,支持我的所有观众 我爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and I just wish I can keep fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只希望自己能一直拼下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's it is hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 有时候真的很难分清
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,to tell whether you are playing in New York
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你到底是在纽约打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,or playing in China at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是在中国打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:17.68,EN,,0,0,0,,The amount of love you have here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里对你的这份喜爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,the support you feel, especially
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你感受到的支持 尤其是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.60,EN,,0,0,0,,as you're coming back from an injury,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,在你从伤病里回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,trying to get back to the top of your game
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,想重新回到最好状态的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,has to be special to have moments like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,有这样的时刻一定很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,this and be reminded why you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,也提醒着你为什么要打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:29.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.48,EN,,0,0,0,,It always special for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to come back here in New York cuz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说永远都很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,it's the first time I make quarterfinal is here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我第一次打进大满贯 1/4 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:40.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in US Open and I just love to play here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是在美网 我很爱在这里打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:42.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Love the passion and everybody brings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这里的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,on the stadium for play tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,喜欢大家带到球场上的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,thank you everyone really cuz really means
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的谢谢每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot this first round but I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场首轮对我意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:53.68,EN,,0,0,0,,so happy today to win this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天能赢下来我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:54.56,EN,,0,0,0,,One more quick thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后再问一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you came through qualifiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 你是从资格赛打上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You've played a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几天你已经
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of tennis the last few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,打了很多场球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Now you get a day off at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在至少能休息一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.04,EN,,0,0,0,,What does Qinwen do in New York
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,钦文在纽约有一天空闲的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.40,EN,,0,0,0,,when you have a day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,都会做些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.72,EN,,0,0,0,,If you're not playing tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果不打球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:11.28,EN,,0,0,0,,what do you enjoy doing around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你喜欢在这儿做点什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, actually when I finished the last round
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实打完资格赛最后一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:18.16,EN,,0,0,0,,of qualies, I got two days luckily and I've
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我幸运地有两天空闲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,been visit the city and went for a really light
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我去逛了逛这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,shopping just few really a few clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,还很轻松地买了点衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I think all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想所有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,the girl knows what mean few clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,女生都懂 一点衣服是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but honestly, one day there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过说实话 一天根本不够
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:32.16,EN,,0,0,0,,We need to keep going on practice
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们还得继续训练
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and, you know, ready for next match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,为下一场做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:37.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, we're so glad you're sticking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:37.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们很高兴你还留在这儿
